What is MVT?
MVT is a design pattern used to build web applications 

Components of MVT?
M - Model  talks about database representation , which is used to store and manage the data.
V - View - it represents the business logic and sends the data to the template.
T - Template - contains HTML and django logic to display the data in HTML format.

MVT Workflow Step by Step
1. User sends a request.
2. URL dispatcher maps request to the view.
3. View interacts with model to get/save data.
4. View sends data to the template.
5. Template renders HTML.
6. HTML is sent as response to user.

( DJANGO Architecture Diagram)
